  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:400px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-_353839 pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Magical Metabolization</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/b4/Thirdack.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20180808210143\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Thirdack\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/b4/Thirdack.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20180808210143\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/b4/Thirdack.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20180808210143 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/b4/Thirdack.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20180808210143 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Thirdack\" width=\"270\" height=\"202\" data-image-key=\"Thirdack.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Thirdack.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Thirdacks (Aladdin: The Animated Series) are extra-dimensional creatures that feed on magic.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Eat magic.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>feed on magical energy</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Magical Energy Absorption\">Magical Energy Absorption</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Empowerment\" title=\"Magic Empowerment\">Magic Empowerment</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Metabolization\" title=\"Metabolization\">Metabolization</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMagic_Metabolization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Eldritch/Magic/Mystokinetic/Mystic/Thaumaturgy Consumption/Feeding/Hunger</li>\n<li>Eldritch/Mystokinetic/Mystic/Thaumaturgy Metabolization</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/thaumavore\">Thaumavory</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMagic_Metabolization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Users can sustain themselves/their powers by feeding off of magic, taking it into their body as a source for their powers and/or conditions.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMagic_Metabolization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Magical Energy Absorption\">Magical Energy Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Metabolization\" title=\"Metabolization\">Metabolization</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMagic_Metabolization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>User may only be able to absorb a certain amount of magic or risk over-dosage</li>\n<li>User may need to discharge Magic after a period of time</li>\n<li>User may not be able to eat anti-magic.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMagic_Metabolization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://aladdin.fandom.com/wiki/Thirdack\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:aladdin:Thirdack\">Thirdack</a> (<i>Aladdin: The Animated Series</i>)</li>\n<li>Charmy Pappitson (<i>Black Clover</i>); via Food Magic</li>\n<li>Users of Capricorn Magic (<i>The Classroom of a Black Cat and a Witch</i>)\n<ul><li>Capella Capricorn</li></ul></li>\n<li>Acnologia (<i>Fairy Tail</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://harrypotter.fandom.com/wiki/en:Chizpurfle\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:harrypotter:en:Chizpurfle\">Chizpurfle</a> (<i>Harry Potter</i>)</li>\n<li>Lord Tirek (<i>My Little Pony: Friendship is Magic</i>)</li>\n<li>Emperor Belos/Philp Wittebane (<i>The Owl House</i>)</li>\n<li>Basilisks (<i>Owl House</i>)\n<ul><li>Vee</li></ul></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260802121518\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 92/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 89/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 126/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   22.450      1 Template:Infobox\n100.00%   22.450      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_powerlisting:pcache:idhash:314469-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260802121518 and revision id 2727902. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
